<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Curse</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 18), Dark Knight (guild level 24)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast curse &lt;target&gt;
cast curse &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>Brings the gods' bad attention down on the target. Cast on a person or 
creature, it lowers their strength, dexterity, brain, charisma and 
constitution by 3 points each. Cast on an object, it becomes cursed: whoever 
wears it can't take it off again.
</p><p>The curse lasts from a minute up to several minutes, longer the better your 
spell, and remove curse lifts it. The target resists with their mind, and the 
spell may fail; cast on someone, it starts a fight either way. Someone 
already cursed can't be cursed more. You must be standing. It is also found 
on scrolls.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Getting_rid_of_a_curse">Getting rid of a curse</span></h2>
<p>A curse doesn't last: it wears off by itself after some minutes. To be rid 
of it sooner:
</p>
<ul><li>ask a Healer, Necromancer or Paladin to cast remove curse on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Curse</a>): it lifts the curse on you and on everything you carry and wear, all at once. Healers learn it at guild level 18, Necromancers and Paladins at 24;</li>
<li>or recite a scroll of remove curse, if you have one.</li></ul>
<p>To see what is cursed, the spell detect curse shows a cursed thing or 
person with an (orange) aura when you look at them (see <a cmd='#'>Help Detect 
Curse</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Curse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Curse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bless</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Abilities</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>